# M10.2's hold (docs/M10_PLAN.md): the game held by its host -- as its in-game menu holds it -- for 6 s while
# standing at the castle front, between two guest-memory snapshots 10 s apart (build/m10/pause_test.py reads the
# game's clocks from them: they must advance by the 4 s not held). Needs DOTHEROES_DEV_STATE=1,
# DOTHEROES_DEV_MEMSNAP=1, DOTHEROES_DEV_STOP=1 (pause.trigger) and a save at the castle (SAVES=).
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START
sleep 3
press START
sleep 5
press CROSS
state life>0,area==17 60
sleep 5
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 2
touch pause.trigger
sleep 6
touch pause.trigger
sleep 2
touch memsnap.trigger
sleep 3
